---
import triad from "../data/triad.json";
const before = triad.before.rule["action_precision@authorized"];
const after = triad.after.rule["action_precision@authorized"];
---

<section id="turn" class="border-t border-line/40">
  <div class="wrap stage stage-center">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">那一转</p>
    <h2 class="reveal measure mt-7 display">
      Q3，我证明它 <span class="text-escalate">不够好</span>。<br />
      Q4，我把它 <span class="gradient-text">修好了。</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="reveal mt-16 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-6 sm:gap-10">
      <div class="card glass border-escalate/30 p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-xs text-muted">Q3 · anti-gaming triad</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold text-escalate">False</div>
        <div class="num mt-1 text-sm text-faint">precision@auth {before.toFixed(2)}</div>
      </div>
      <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#34d399" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" /></svg>
      <div class="card glass border-brand/50 p-6 text-center shadow-glow">
        <div class="text-xs text-muted">Q4 · 留出测试集</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand">True</div>
        <div class="num mt-1 text-sm text-faint">precision@auth {after.toFixed(2)}</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="reveal mx-auto mt-12 max-w-2xl lead">
      在一个<span class="text-ink">校准从未见过的留出测试集</span>上把门推过去——
      <span class="text-ink">没碰阈值、validator 字节级未变、安全地板（F11/F13=0）完好。</span>
      这是「诚实地把 agent 修到够好，且证明没作弊」。
    </p>
    <p class="reveal num mt-5 text-xs text-faint">真但薄：过 ~1 个 case（11/17）；6/17 残留是小语料检索边界，已如实记录。</p>
  </div>
</section>
